  "title": "Google Research and Synaptics Partner to Showcase Immersive Edge AI Experiences Powered by the Coralboard™ at Google I/O 2026",
  "summary": "Synaptics® Incorporated (Nasdaq: SYNA) and Google Research will spotlight Edge AI use cases on the recently announced Synaptics Coralboard™ at Google I/O 2026. The Coralboard is designed to help developers move faster from prototyping to real-world Edge AI product development. Powered by the Synaptics Astra™ SL2610 product line with the Synaptics Torq™ NPU and Coral NPU technology from Google Research, the development board offers an open, feature-rich and standards-based platform for bringing multimodal on-device AI experiences to life.",
